AB  - Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) is a practical way to turn internal documents into a question answering assistant, but many deployments still send user queries and retrieved text to external inference endpoints at query time. For sensitive enterprise knowledge bases, this creates an awkward situation: the system may be helpful, yet the data flow is hard to defend and even harder to audit.
